      "decision_id": "campaign-c0761df29478459ab4cea725626ea259-7-eb71418166-dec-000146",
      "private_thought": "Need Virginia to complete pinks, but $350 leaves $336 = only 3 houses and $36, and funds p2's dark blues (1 house each; Park/BW house=$200). They have $285; under ~$215 they cannot reach 3 houses even mortgaging all 3 RRs. Counter $200: cash left $486 \u2192 4 houses (2-1-1) + $86. Can stretch to ~$250 to close, not $350. Do not give CT (blocks p3 light blues), St. James, PA, or B&O.",
      "public_message": "Can't do $350 \u2014 that premium leaves me nothing to build, which is the only reason Virginia is worth more than you just paid. $200. You book a quick profit, I can actually develop. That's the deal.",
      "schema_version": "v1"
    },
    "147": {
      "action": "counter_trade",
      "args": {
        "offer": {
          "cash": 0,
          "get_out_of_jail_cards": 0,
          "properties": [
            "VIRGINIA_AVENUE"
          ]
        },
        "request": {
          "cash": 275,
          "get_out_of_jail_cards": 0,
          "properties": []
        }
      },
      "decision_id": "campaign-c0761df29478459ab4cea725626ea259-7-eb71418166-dec-000147",
      "public_message": "A monopoly for $200 is way too cheap. $275 still leaves you over $400 to build three houses right away. That's fair.",
      "schema_version": "v1"
    },
    "148": {
      "action": "counter_trade",
      "args": {
        "offer": {
          "cash": 210,
          "get_out_of_jail_cards": 0,
          "properties": []
        },
        "request": {
          "cash": 0,
          "get_out_of_jail_cards": 0,
          "properties": [
            "VIRGINIA_AVENUE"
          ]
        }
      },
      "decision_id": "campaign-c0761df29478459ab4cea725626ea259-7-eb71418166-dec-000148",
      "private_thought": "Do not accept $275. Cash $686; $275 leaves $411 = 4 pink houses only, same as $210 ($476). p2 has $285 + 3 RRs mortgageable for $300 = $585. +4 dark-blue houses ($800, to 3-3) needs $215 from me. $210 keeps them $5 short even fully mortgaged; they can already reach 2-2 without me. $210 is negotiation grease vs rejected $200, still under the line. Never give CT (p3 has Oriental+Vermont), St. James, PA, or B&O. p3 now owns full reds with $429 \u2014 pinks are my only answer, so close this if they take $210.",
      "public_message": "$210, final. That's a $50 same-turn profit on a deed you can't develop, and it's the most I can pay and still put houses on the set. Above that Virginia isn't worth it to me.",
      "schema_version": "v1"
    },
    "149": {
      "action": "counter_trade",
      "args": {
        "offer": {
          "cash": 0,
          "get_out_of_jail_cards": 0,
          "properties": [
