          ]
        }
      },
      "decision_id": "campaign-c0761df29478459ab4cea725626ea259-7-eb71418166-dec-000150",
      "private_thought": "Do not cross $214. If holdings are current, p2 has $285 + $300 RR mortgage = $585; 4 dark-blue houses to 3-3 cost $800, so they need $215 from me. $210 leaves them $5 short; $240 lets them. They can already reach 2-2 without me. If the p3 trade actually cleared (log says yes, holdings don't), they're cash-poor and $210 still closes or they come back \u2014 $30 isn't worth a 3-house Boardwalk. No CT, St. James, PA, or B&O.",
      "public_message": "$210, same number, and it's the ceiling. You paid $160 a minute ago for a deed you can't build on \u2014 that's a $50 same-turn profit. Anything above that and I can't house the set, so the monopoly isn't worth buying. Take the profit.",
      "schema_version": "v1"
